"/","children":"← Back to the studio"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"section-index","children":"WEBSITE & ENQUIRIES"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":["Your",["$","br",null,{}],["$","em",null,{"children":"privacy."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"How information is handled when you visit or get in touch."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"terms-meta","children":["$","time",null,{"dateTime":"2026-10-29","children":"Updated 29 October 2026"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"terms-sections","children":[[["$","section","Who we are",{"id":"$undefined","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"01"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Who we are"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Vertex Models is responsible for this website and for the personal information described in this notice (the “controller” under data-protection law). We are based in Dubai, UAE. For anything about your information, contact us at info@vertexmodels.ae."}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","Website visits",{"id":"$undefined","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"02"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Website visits"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"This website presents our work and invites enquiries. It has no customer account, online checkout or file-upload form. The project brief and feedback forms prepare text in your browser for your review. Entering or reviewing text does not submit it. You can download it or send it from your email application. Where the direct-send option is shown, it only submits your enquiry after you click Send enquiry, as described below. We do not store enquiries in a website database, and closing or reloading the page clears the form. We have not added advertising pixels or social-media trackers."}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","Hosting",{"id":"hosting","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"03"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Hosting"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, provided by GitHub, Inc. (a Microsoft company). When you visit, GitHub logs and stores your IP address, along with technical request information such as the pages requested and your browser details, for security purposes, whether or not you have a GitHub account. We do not receive or use those logs. They may be processed in the United States and other countries under GitHub’s own terms."}],"$undefined",["$","p",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub Privacy Statement ↗</a>"}}]]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"],"$L1f"]}]]}],"$L20"]]
21:T5d5,If you use direct sending, your name, email address and message are sent from your browser to Web3Forms, which forwards the enquiry by email to info@vertexmodels.ae. Web3Forms is operated from India and uses infrastructure providers, including Amazon Web Services, Cloudflare and Hetzner, that may process data in several countries, including the United States. Web3Forms states that form submissions are kept for a maximum of three years unless a shorter period applies or they are deleted earlier, and that it uses spam-prevention services that may receive the IP address and email address of the person submitting a form. Before you can send, an hCaptcha spam check, provided by Intuition Machines, Inc. in the United States, is loaded from hCaptcha’s servers only when you click Continue to send. It processes technical information such as your IP address, browser details and how you interact with the check, and may use its own cookies or similar storage. If you prefer, you can skip direct sending and use your own email application instead. Form contents and email addresses are never sent to Google Analytics. A delivery-service acceptance does not guarantee inbox arrival or constitute acceptance of a project. Client feedback stays private unless you separately tick the box allowing publication of your exact words and chosen attribution. We review feedback before publishing it and never display your email address. Contact us to discuss or withdraw that permission at any time.16:["$","section","Forms and direct sending",{"id":"forms","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"04"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Forms and direct sending"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"$21"}],"$undefined",["$","p",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<a href=\"https://web3forms.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Web3Forms privacy policy</a> · <a href=\"https://www.hcaptcha.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hCaptcha privacy policy</a>"}}]]}]
22:T440,Google Analytics loads only if you choose Allow analytics in the consent banner. It helps us understand page visits, broad traffic sources, email-button clicks, and whether a project brief was prepared. We also record an event when the direct-send service accepts an enquiry. Preparing a brief or clicking an email button does not confirm that an enquiry was sent, and service acceptance does not confirm inbox arrival. Our tracking code does not send names, email addresses, brief contents, full email links or URL query strings. Google may process technical information, including your IP address, to provide the service, and may do so in the United States and other countries; this should not be understood as completely anonymous tracking. Advertising personalisation and Google signals are disabled. You can change or withdraw your choice at any time using Analytics preferences in the footer. Withdrawing stops future tracking and removes our analytics cookies on this browser; it does not erase data already processed. Declining does not prevent you from browsing or contacting us.17:["$","section","Optional analytics",{"id":"analytics","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"05"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Optional analytics"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"$22"}],"$undefined",["$","p",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<a href=\"https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How Google uses information from sites that use its services ↗</a>"}}]]}]
18:["$","section","Cookies and similar technologies",{"id":"cookies","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"06"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Cookies and similar technologies"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"This is everything the website stores in your browser. We do not use advertising or social-media cookies."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"terms-list","children":[["$","li","vertex-analytics-consent-v1 (local storage, this site): remembers whether you allowed or declined analytics. It is kept for up to 180 days or until you change your choice. This is necessary to respect your choice.",{"children":"vertex-analytics-consent-v1 (local storage, this site): remembers whether you allowed or declined analytics. It is kept for up to 180 days or until you change your choice. This is necessary to respect your choice."}],["$","li","vertex_ga and vertex_ga_S8V189QYMS (cookies, set by Google Analytics): only if you allow analytics. They distinguish visits and sessions and last up to 180 days. They are removed when you withdraw permission.",{"children":"vertex_ga and vertex_ga_S8V189QYMS (cookies, set by Google Analytics): only if you allow analytics. They distinguish visits and sessions and last up to 180 days. They are removed when you withdraw permission."}],["$","li","vertex-send-log (local storage, this site): only if you use direct sending. It stores the times of your recent sends, for up to one hour, so we can limit repeated submissions from one browser.",{"children":"vertex-send-log (local storage, this site): only if you use direct sending. It stores the times of your recent sends, for up to one hour, so we can limit repeated submissions from one browser."}],["$","li","hCaptcha (hcaptcha.com): loaded only when you click Continue to send. hCaptcha may set its own cookies or use similar storage to run the spam check, under its own policy.",{"children":"hCaptcha (hcaptcha.com): loaded only when you click Continue to send. hCaptcha may set its own cookies or use similar storage to run the spam check, under its own policy."}],["$","li","Hosting: GitHub Pages logs IP addresses for security, as described under Hosting. We do not set cookies for hosting.",{"children":"Hosting: GitHub Pages logs IP addresses for security, as described under Hosting. We do not set cookies for hosting."}]]}],"$undefined"]}]
19:["$","section","Enquiries and project information",{"id":"enquiries","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"07"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Enquiries and project information"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"An email link opens your email application. Sending an enquiry shares the information you choose to include, such as your name, contact details and project brief, with the people handling the enquiry and the email services used to send and receive it. If you want to share files, send a link in your enquiry or ask us how to transfer them. We use this information to respond, prepare a quotation and, if agreed, coordinate the project. We do not use an enquiry as consent to unrelated promotional messages."}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1a:["$","section","Why we use your information",{"id":"legal-bases","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"08"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why we use your information"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Where the EU or UK GDPR applies, we rely on the following legal bases."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"terms-list","children":[["$","li","Consent: for optional Google Analytics and for publishing feedback. You can withdraw consent at any time without affecting earlier processing.",{"children":"Consent: for optional Google Analytics and for publishing feedback. You can withdraw consent at any time without affecting earlier processing."}],["$","li","Legitimate interests: responding to enquiries, running and securing our business and keeping the website working, balanced against your rights.",{"children":"Legitimate interests: responding to enquiries, running and securing our business and keeping the website working, balanced against your rights."}],["$","li","Steps you ask us to take before entering a contract, such as preparing a quotation.",{"children":"Steps you ask us to take before entering a contract, such as preparing a quotation."}],["$","li","Legal obligations, where they apply.",{"children":"Legal obligations, where they apply."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Under the UAE Personal Data Protection Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021), we process your information with your consent, or where it is necessary to respond to your request, to take steps towards or perform a contract, or to meet a legal obligation, as that law allows."}}]]}]
1b:["$","section","Who may receive information",{"id":"sharing","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"09"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Who may receive information"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Relevant information may be shared with specialist production or delivery partners where needed to prepare or carry out an agreed commission, subject to appropriate confidentiality arrangements. Providers that support the website and our communications may process information for those purposes: GitHub (hosting), Web3Forms and its infrastructure providers (direct sending), hCaptcha (spam check), Google (optional analytics) and our email provider. We do not sell your information. We may disclose information where required by law. These providers may process information in countries outside the UAE, including the United States and India. Where transfers are made, we rely on the safeguards the providers offer, such as contractual clauses, and on your consent where the law requires it. Applicable data-protection requirements still apply."}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1c:["$","section","Retention and protection",{"id":"retention","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"10"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Retention and protection"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Enquiry emails are kept for as long as reasonably needed for the enquiry or project and for any record-keeping, dispute or legal obligations. Web3Forms keeps submissions for up to three years unless a shorter period applies or they are deleted sooner. Your analytics choice is remembered for 180 days. Access is limited to people who need it for these purposes. No online service or email transmission can be guaranteed completely secure. Before sending highly confidential drawings or sensitive personal information, contact us to agree a suitable transfer method."}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1d:["$","section","Your rights",{"id":"rights","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"11"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Your rights"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Under the UAE Personal Data Protection Law, and under the GDPR where it applies to you, you may have the right to ask for access to your personal information, to correct it, to have it erased, to restrict or object to how we use it, to receive a copy in a portable format, and to withdraw consent at any time. To make a request, email info@vertexmodels.ae. We may need to verify your identity, and we will reply within the time the law requires. Some rights depend on the legal basis and may be limited by law. You also have the right to complain to a data-protection authority, such as the UAE Data Office or your local supervisory authority in the EU or UK. Our website is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly collect their personal information."}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1e:["$","section","Questions and changes",{"id":"changes","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"terms-number","children":"12"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Questions and changes"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Contact info@vertexmodels.ae with any question about this notice. The person or entity responsible for a commissioned project is identified in its quotation or agreement. We will update this notice, and its date, when our practices change."}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
